{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T3E826g9j81793198256.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>保安局推出國家安全主題繪本，向幼稚園學生推廣國安訊息。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOOK-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QOMUlAP9Eg1793198279.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>保安局局長鄧炳強、教育局副局長施俊輝，在漫畫主角「安仔」與「熊仔」陪同下，為新書揭幕。繼去年推出的國安漫畫本，保安局推出新一輯共三本繪本，以圖畫形式，帶出維護國家安全概念，並同步推出主題曲。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOOK-1730_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nxOhHdk6ej1793198268.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄧炳強表示，早前已專門為小學生推出國安漫畫，現時期望將主題推廣至幼稚園，透過圖畫故事形式，解釋《國安法》的複雜概念，同時創作出歌曲及老師使用手冊，方便教學。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:21.992451+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:13.926539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:27.447518+00:00","content_hash":"ac67a9e63b80701f39e4582a3570bf070f89cbd0cc29a338e549a23087861459","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:21.992451+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}